***************************
* SET UP THE INITIAL DATA *
***************************

NAME          S308NE

*   Problem :
*   *********

*   Source: problem 308 in
*   K. Schittkowski,
*   " More Test Problems for Nonlinear Programming Codes",
*   Springer Verlag, Berlin, 1987.

*   SIF input: Ph. Toint, April 1991.
*   Nonlinear-equations version of S308.SIF, Nick Gould, Jan 2020.

*   classification NOR2-AN-2-3

VARIABLES

    X1
    X2

GROUPS

 E  O1
 E  O2
 E  O3

BOUNDS

 FR S308      'DEFAULT'

START POINT

 XV S308      X1        3.0
 XV S308      X2        0.1

ELEMENT TYPE

 EV QUAD      X                        Y
 EV SINE      X
 EV COSN      X

ELEMENT USES

 T  EQ        QUAD
 ZV EQ        X                        X1
 ZV EQ        Y                        X2

 T  ES        SINE
 ZV ES        X                        X1

 T  EC        COSN
 ZV EC        X                        X2

GROUP USES

 E  O1        EQ
 E  O2        ES
 E  O3        EC

OBJECT BOUND

 LO S308                0.0

*   Solution

*LO SOLTN               0.773199

ENDATA

***********************
* SET UP THE FUNCTION *
* AND RANGE ROUTINES  *
***********************

ELEMENTS      S308NE

TEMPORARIES

 R  COSX
 R  SINX
 M  COS
 M  SIN

INDIVIDUALS

 T  QUAD
 F                      X * X + X * Y + Y * Y
 G  X                   2.0 * X + Y
 G  Y                   2.0 * Y + X
 H  X         X         2.0
 H  X         Y         1.0
 H  Y         Y         2.0

 T  SINE
 A  SINX                SIN(X)
 F                      SINX
 G  X                   COS(X)
 H  X         X         - SINX

 T  COSN
 A  COSX                COS(X)
 F                      COSX
 G  X                   - SIN(X)
 H  X         X         - COSX
ENDATA
